      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Posts – Publisher\nEvery 15 min (manual run skips the working-hours check): pause → 429 wait (Logs) → weekdays + working hours → daily limit → ≥4 h gap → ONE due **approved** post → POST /rest/posts as the company page (+ image_urn) →\n- 201: **published** + post_urn\n- 429: logged, no calls until midnight UTC (no retry loop)\n- any other error: **paused = TRUE** + alert email\nEvery outcome is logged.",
